{
  "label": "Advanced Search",
  "category": "Alert Issuer",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Advanced Search & Filtering",
      "id": "advanced-search",
      "intro": "Advanced Search memungkinkan filter alert dengan kriteria spesifik. Support multiple filters dan save filter preset untuk quick access.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Membuka Advanced Search",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik tombol **Filter** atau **🔍 Search** di toolbar\n• Dialog/panel search akan muncul\n• Semua filter fields akan visible\n• Bisa collapse/expand sections\n• Klik **Clear** untuk reset semua filter",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #eff6ff;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#eff6ff,#fff);\"><div style=\"width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3b82f6,#2563eb);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Advanced Search</span></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;font-size:10px;color:#64748b;text-align:center;\">Filter alerts with specific criteria</div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Filter by Date Range",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Date Range Picker** dengan preset:\n  - Today\n  - Last 7 days\n  - Last 30 days\n  - Last 90 days\n  - Custom range\n• Pilih **From** dan **To** date\n• Time picker optional untuk filter lebih presisi\n• Apply date filter untuk lihat alert dalam range tertentu",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;\">Date Range</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:4px;margin-bottom:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">Today</span><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">Last 7 days</span><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#eef2ff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#6366f1;\">Last 30 days</span><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">Custom</span></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">From</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">01/01/2024</div></div><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">To</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">31/01/2024</div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Filter by Alert & Transaction Info",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Alert ID** — Search by specific alert ID\n• **UTRNNO** — Universal Transaction Number\n• **Cardholder Name** — Nama pemegang kartu\n• **Card Number** — Last 4 digits atau full (masked)\n• **Amount Range** — Min dan Max amount\n• **Risk Score Range** — Filter by risk score (0-100)\n• Support partial match untuk text fields",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;\">Alert & Transaction</div><div style=\"display:grid;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;\">Alert ID</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">ALI-2024-*</div></div><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;\">Cardholder</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">John Doe</div></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">Min Amount</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">Rp 0</div></div><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">Max Amount</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">Rp 10,000,000</div></div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Filter by Status & Classification",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Classification**:\n  - NEGATIVE (Not Fraud)\n  - SUSPICIOUS\n  - POSITIVE (Fraud)\n  - Multiple selection allowed\n• **Status**:\n  - Open\n  - In Progress\n  - Resolved\n  - Closed\n• **Lock Status**:\n  - Locked\n  - Unlocked\n  - Locked by me\n• **Assigned To**: Filter by user/team",
          "color": "#14b8a6",
          "bg": "#f0fdfa",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #99f6e4;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;\">Status & Classification</div><div style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;\">Classification</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #86efac;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">✓ NEGATIVE</span><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">SUSPICIOUS</span><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fca5a5;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">✓ POSITIVE</span></div></div><div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;\">Status</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#eff6ff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#3b82f6;\">✓ Open</span><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">In Progress</span><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;\">Resolved</span></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "Save & Apply Filter Preset",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Setelah set filter, klik **Save Filter**\n• Beri nama preset (e.g., \"High Risk Alerts\")\n• Preset tersimpan untuk quick access\n• Load preset dengan klik nama preset\n• Bisa edit atau delete preset\n• Share preset dengan team (optional)\n• Klik **Apply** untuk eksekusi filter",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #fde68a;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;\">Saved Filters</div><div style=\"display:grid;gap:4px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">High Risk Alerts</span><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">Risk > 80</span></div><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">Last 7 Days Open</span><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">Date + Status</span></div><div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">My Locked Alerts</span><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">Assigned to me</span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;\"><button style=\"padding:8px 14px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;cursor:pointer;flex:1;\">Save Filter</button><button style=\"padding:8px 14px;border-radius:6px;background:#f59e0b;border:none;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;flex:1;\">Apply</button></div></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
